// Workspace enablement for native (Nominal-published) containerized extractors.
//
// The deployment's installable catalog is populated exclusively by internal catalog sync (the
// bootstrap Job seeds object storage, combined-service mirrors the verified index) — there is no
// public API for registering catalog content. This service is the workspace-facing surface on top
// of that catalog: browse what the deployment carries, enable an entry into a workspace (which
// materializes a FIRST_PARTY ContainerizedExtractor backed by a registry image imported from the
// staged catalog artifacts), converge an installation to a desired version, and disable it again.
//
// Enable reconciles synchronously within the request: the caller's credentials are needed
// to register new resources with the authorization service and to import the container image, so
// convergence happens while they are present. Both are idempotent — re-running a converged
// installation is a no-op.

